{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":103,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝的慈愛"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我的心啊，要稱頌耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的肺腑心腸啊，要稱頌祂的聖名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心啊，要稱頌耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要忘記祂的一切恩惠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂赦免你一切的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醫治你一切的疾病。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂救贖你的生命脫離死亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以慈愛和憐憫環繞你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂以美物滿足你的願望，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你如鷹一般恢復青春。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和華為一切受欺壓的人伸張正義，主持公道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂讓摩西明白自己的旨意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向以色列人彰顯自己的作為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華好憐憫，有恩典，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不輕易發怒，充滿慈愛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂不永久責備人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不永遠懷怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂沒有按我們的罪惡對待我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有照我們的罪過懲罰我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為天離地有多高，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂對敬畏祂之人的愛也多大！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"東離西有多遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂叫我們的過犯離我們也多遠！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華憐愛敬畏祂的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同慈父憐愛自己的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂知道我們的本源，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"顧念我們不過是塵土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"世人的年日如同草芥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如野地茂盛的花，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一經風吹，便無影無蹤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從原處永遠消逝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華永永遠遠愛敬畏祂的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公義待他們的子子孫孫，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是那些守祂的約、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一心遵行祂命令的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和華在天上設立了寶座，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的王權統管萬有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽從耶和華的命令、遵行祂吩咐的大能天使啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要稱頌祂！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事奉耶和華、遵從祂旨意的天軍啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要稱頌祂！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華所造的萬物啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在祂掌管的各處稱頌祂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心啊，要稱頌耶和華！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/103.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/104.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/102.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}